  "bio": "Panthera Ink, rooted in the atmospheric city of Neunkirchen, Germany, stands as a pioneer in vegan and cruelty-free tattoo creation. Masterfully crafting black and gray, realism tattoos, this popular studio boasts over 100k followers on Instagram. As a professional factory for world-renowned tattoo artists, Panthera Ink embodies perfection, compassion, and tradition all in one stroke - distinctly Made in Italy."
